## Examples (Ví dụ)

### Ví dụ: Complete DDD Design

```typescript
// Order Aggregate with Domain Events
class Order extends AggregateRoot {
  // ... implementation
  
  submit() {
    // Validate business rules
    if (this.items.isEmpty()) {
      throw new DomainException('Order must have items');
    }
    
    // Change state
    this.status = OrderStatus.SUBMITTED;
    
    // Emit domain event
    this.addDomainEvent(new OrderSubmitted(
      this.id,
      this.customerId,
      this.calculateTotal()
    ));
  }
}
```

